          "choices": ["trunc", "round"]
        }
      ],
      "budget_share": 0.4,
      "why": "Only family with guaranteed 1 result/cycle throughput. To hit 400 MSPS, Fmax must be >= 400 MHz. Pipelined has the longest critical path (N stages), so it is the hardest to meet 400 MHz. We search a wide range of n_iter (12-18) to find the minimum N that meets accuracy (err <= 2^-12) while keeping the pipeline short enough for high Fmax. data_width 12-18 balances accuracy vs LUT cost."
    },
    {
      "family": "pipelined_m",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "param": "data_width",
          "low": 12,
          "high": 18
        ,
          "choices": null
        },
        {
